1
00:00:00,191 --> 00:00:02,361
(romantic music playing)

2
00:00:04,395 --> 00:00:06,325
(knocking)
SHELDON: Birthday girl.

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:09,600
(Sheldon:)Birthday girl.
Birthday girl.

4
00:00:12,069 --> 00:00:13,639
Come in!

5
00:00:13,637 --> 00:00:16,407
Oh!

6
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:22,509
(Amy:)Hi, Sheldon.

7
00:00:22,513 --> 00:00:23,983
(Sheldon:)Hello. Sorry I'm late.

8
00:00:23,981 --> 00:00:25,581
(Sheldon:)I also got you a balloon,

9
00:00:25,583 --> 00:00:28,283
(Sheldon:)but it floated away,
and I chased it for a while.

10
00:00:28,285 --> 00:00:30,885
(Amy:)That's okay. Come on in.

11
00:00:30,888 --> 00:00:32,188
(Sheldon:)Thank you.
Mm-hmm.

12
00:00:32,189 --> 00:00:35,089
(Amy:)Um, I'll... I'm gonna go put
these in water.

13
00:00:35,092 --> 00:00:36,762
(Amy:)Okay.

14
00:00:36,761 --> 00:00:39,391
(Sheldon:)Ooh, this is different, hmm?

15
00:00:39,397 --> 00:00:41,197
(Sheldon:)Candles and music.

16
00:00:41,198 --> 00:00:42,698
(Amy:)Do you like it?

17
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,930
(Sheldon:)It's kind of spooky.

18
00:00:44,935 --> 00:00:46,705
(Amy:)I can change it back.

19
00:00:46,704 --> 00:00:48,234
(Sheldon:)No, no, no. It's your birthday.

20
00:00:48,239 --> 00:00:51,939
(Sheldon:)As long as no one jumps out
in a hockey mask, I'll be fine.

21
00:00:52,777 --> 00:00:55,607
(panting)

